msgid ""
"data/events_special_multiverse.xml.append$//mod:findName[@name=\"THE_JUDGES_ROCKMAN_REAL\"]/mod-"
"append:choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"AHAHAHAHA! WHAT is THIS?! A AUGMENT that can make CREW out of FUEL?! "
"AHAHAHA! Renegade, I thank you for the ENTRETAINEMENT you gave me by showing"
" me THIS! AHAHAH! Yes, this IS tribute! I shall BLESS you with the BLESSING "
"OF CLONING. But have PATIENCE. It is not for now, but for LATER!\""

